OL,3,CMan, 79, seriously injured by dog in
OL,4,CPlymouth
OL,6,FPolice are urging a dog walker to come
OL,7,Fforward after a 79-year-old man was
OL,8,Fseriously injured following an
OL,9,Fincident involving a dog in Plymouth.
OL,11,FThe incident took place at around
OL,12,F9.15am on Saturday 1 August near The
OL,13,FSundial on Armada Way, Plymouth.
OL,15,FDevon and Cornwall Police said a 79-
OL,16,Fyear-old man had reportedly been
OL,17,Fwalking in the area when he was jumped
OL,18,Fat by a large black dog which was not
OL,19,Fon a lead, causing him to fall and
OL,20,Fsuffer a serious head injury.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
