CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785761309
OL,3,CMan, 79, seriously injured by dog in
OL,4,CPlymouth
OL,6,FThe man's injuries have been described
OL,7,Fas potentially life-threatening and he
OL,8,Fremains in hospital.
OL,10,FOfficers are asking for the dog owner
OL,11,Fto come forward and also want to speak
OL,12,Fto anyone who helped at the scene who
OL,13,Fmay have information about the
OL,14,Fincident.
OL,16,FWitnesses are being urged to contact
OL,17,Fthe police force on its website or by
OL,18,Fcalling 101 quoting reference number
OL,19,F50260203507.
